{%- comment -%}
  Minimalna wartość zamówienia i próg darmowej dostawy w koszyku (07.10.2026, „Warunki współpracy”: min. 2000 zł netto,
  dostawa gratis w Polsce od 5000 zł netto). Ceny w sklepie są netto, więc porównujemy items_subtotal_price.
  Progi w ustawieniach motywu (grupa B2B): b2b_min_order_pln / b2b_min_order_eur / b2b_min_order_usd (28.10.2026, rynek spoza Europy) / b2b_free_shipping_pln.
  check: true → wypisuje „1”, gdy koszyk jest poniżej minimum (do zablokowania przycisku „Realizuj zakup”);
  bez check → komunikat dla klienta. UWAGA: samą darmową stawkę wysyłki trzeba ustawić w panelu (Wysyłka i dostawa).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign min = 0
  case cart.currency.iso_code
    when 'PLN'
      assign min = settings.b2b_min_order_pln | default: 0
    when 'EUR'
      assign min = settings.b2b_min_order_eur | default: 0
    when 'USD'
      assign min = settings.b2b_min_order_usd | default: 0
  endcase
  assign min_cents = min | times: 100
  assign subtotal = cart.items_subtotal_price
  assign below = false
  if cart.item_count > 0 and min_cents > 0 and subtotal < min_cents
    assign below = true
  endif
  comment
    01.11.2026 (Adrian): maszyna robi minimum 2 szt. jednego koloru — pozycja poniżej blokuje zamówienie jak brak minimum.
    20.11.2026 (Adrian): minimum 10 szt. — próg w ustawieniu b2b_min_per_color.
  endcomment
  assign min_color = settings.b2b_min_per_color | default: 10
  assign few = ''
  for item in cart.items
    if item.quantity < min_color
      assign few_t = item.product.title | escape
      assign few_v = item.variant.title | escape
      assign few = few | append: few_t | append: ' (' | append: few_v | append: ')|'
    endif
  endfor
  assign few_list = few | split: '|' | join: ', '
  if few != ''
    assign below = true
  endif
  assign free_cents = 0
  if cart.currency.iso_code == 'PLN'
    assign free_cents = settings.b2b_free_shipping_pln | default: 0 | times: 100
  endif
-%}
{%- if check -%}
  {%- if below -%}1{%- endif -%}
{%- elsif cart.item_count > 0 -%}
  {%- if few != '' -%}
    <p class="b2b-cart-note b2b-cart-note--warn" role="status">
      {{ 'b2b.cart.min_per_color_html' | t: min: min_color, items: few_list }}
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if below and subtotal < min_cents -%}
    {%- assign missing = min_cents | minus: subtotal | money -%}
    {%- assign min_fmt = min_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
    <p class="b2b-cart-note b2b-cart-note--warn" role="status">
      {{ 'b2b.cart.min_order_html' | t: min: min_fmt, missing: missing }}
    </p>
  {%- elsif below -%}
  {%- elsif free_cents > 0 and subtotal < free_cents -%}
    {%- assign missing = free_cents | minus: subtotal | money -%}
    <p class="b2b-cart-note" role="status">{{ 'b2b.cart.free_shipping_missing_html' | t: missing: missing }}</p>
  {%- elsif free_cents > 0 -%}
    <p class="b2b-cart-note b2b-cart-note--ok" role="status">{{ 'b2b.cart.free_shipping_ok' | t }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Black Week 23.11 00:00 – 27.11 23:59 (Europe/Warsaw), 22.11.2026 (Adrian): rabat procentowy od liczby sztuk
    (−4% od 100, −7% od 200, −10% od 350, −15% od 500 szt.; rabaty automatyczne w panelu, nie łączą się z rabatem ilościowym).
    Licznik pokazuje, ile sztuk brakuje do kolejnego progu — działa w każdej walucie.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign now_s = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- if now_s >= 1795388400 and now_s <= 1795820399 -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign bw_tiers = '100:4,200:7,350:10,500:15' | split: ','
      assign bw_pcs = cart.item_count
      assign bw_has = 0
      assign bw_next = 0
      assign bw_next_min = 0
      for t in bw_tiers
        assign tp = t | split: ':'
        assign t_min = tp[0] | plus: 0
        assign t_pct = tp[1] | plus: 0
        if bw_pcs >= t_min
          assign bw_has = t_pct
        elsif bw_next == 0
          assign bw_next = t_pct
          assign bw_next_min = t_min
        endif
      endfor
      assign bw_missing = bw_next_min | minus: bw_pcs
    -%}
    <p class="b2b-cart-note b2b-cart-note--campaign" role="status">
      {%- if bw_next == 0 -%}
        {{ 'b2b.campaign.cart_max_html' | t: bonus: bw_has }}
      {%- elsif bw_has == 0 -%}
        {{ 'b2b.campaign.cart_missing_html' | t: next: bw_next, missing: bw_missing }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ 'b2b.campaign.cart_has_html' | t: bonus: bw_has, next: bw_next, missing: bw_missing }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
